msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_0645E338_30D8_4F9C_B63C_904B2053A2DE"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫............"

#: scenario5:scenario5_8CE805DC_7849_4D48_9836_CA4AD21D857E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f904c8631faba563d5776a0bedfd5162689b5cabb36419005737694c4b549fd9
#. default-sha256: b337ce362847707607378c6ad7282a3320ae235a7bb7f47edc11a36b44318c6d
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_8CE805DC_7849_4D48_9836_CA4AD21D857E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫How did we get to this point?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Comment en sommes-nous arrivés là ?"

#: scenario5:scenario5_1A87FAFA_5514_404A_B48E_D4BE7EF7560E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a6fb4350fb0fed01cdae5221cf83af50e1da4901722802b40dbeb6f6a8ba9e43
#. default-sha256: 4de48d106d0d577f6888a05103750bb2dfa2d4820e21191347a907a79057b182
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_1A87FAFA_5514_404A_B48E_D4BE7EF7560E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Ugh... ⟪k:1⟫I hate everything."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Rah... ⟪k:1⟫Tout me fait horreur."

#: scenario5:scenario5_95EC823A_55AB_4389_BA08_FBADAA9590FC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 34e2411664a4f16c7b7cd7a98a28165ececa39c9f5ef15ec0885574accb3bbd3
#. default-sha256: 446d0687f2f7eeb2a8bca8b9881451f63b742538a359188d0f56bbd88a23e39d
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_95EC823A_55AB_4389_BA08_FBADAA9590FC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫My spirits were getting darker and darker, like they were slowly sinking into a deep morass."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mon moral s’assombrissait de plus en plus, comme s’il s’enfonçait lentement au fond d’un "
"abysse."

#: scenario5:scenario5_22EA8AC8_5551_48D4_A5DD_E8DB040D0DFF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d9c58686acf770a6353713b9dfdfd7b7df2fbde32694f1c4d2a757b606dbd4b0
#. default-sha256: dcc479897456b754b7333a1fd4ec850dcda02c854b039ce9887b646b224e2a2b
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_22EA8AC8_5551_48D4_A5DD_E8DB040D0DFF"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I had been at the mansion for a month, ⟪k:1⟫and every day since felt twice as long as it "
"should have."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Cela faisait un mois que j’étais au manoir, ⟪k:1⟫et chaque jour en avait compté le double."

#: scenario5:scenario5_FC326764_576F_4F38_86F5_E5E79EFD1249
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 62490fc0158681243a80e5c6df95c68069c881560ec7ecbab630a1718cad22bc
#. default-sha256: 848a77f9c04d31bba7267a573411ccd1216b3a88719d8a594dff24afb393479a
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_FC326764_576F_4F38_86F5_E5E79EFD1249"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I had been optimistic, at first. ⟪k:1⟫I’d even had a little hope that me and Michel could "
"get along together."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫J’avais été optimiste, au début. ⟪k:1⟫J’avais même eu l’espoir que Michel et moi nous "
"entendions."

#: scenario5:scenario5_BA4AB3D0_212C_41CB_B5F1_EA9EF2F48D8B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c2323f1cbc6b7151916e20a2a584db76c644eaa9e4e0a947d360efebca080743
#. default-sha256: 0348eb51edad88c5f5c94acb7656638ba41e87167dade768b65a794c8cb773d2
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_BA4AB3D0_212C_41CB_B5F1_EA9EF2F48D8B"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫But it hadn’t taken long for that hope to be shattered,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Mais il n’avait pas fallu longtemps pour que mes espoirs volent en éclats"

#: scenario5:scenario5_827444A5_465E_4627_8BFD_97B4B87F05B7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0cad156937c139245d2b6e6a73bd6c9a08fca8e7c306e327aa5797826d9ffa3e
#. default-sha256: dcfee68998fce673dc7b4b06a1bdcef8eee39aeab765e0dc2eb15a12e80415ab
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_827444A5_465E_4627_8BFD_97B4B87F05B7"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫and the cheer locked away inside me."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫et que ma gaieté habituelle s’érode."

#: scenario5:scenario5_28C38AE5_B643_4CA7_A431_756C7211C6EC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 79c0d92a6580d86437f5532fd31688101da4ba4888f4581431b6d55d9dfba912
#. default-sha256: 717cfffe256e5eca193ecb2d2cd7ecac33621564b814b3ca51f078fccf77148c
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_28C38AE5_B643_4CA7_A431_756C7211C6EC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫We lived in the same house, but we never spoke anymore. ⟪k:1⟫On the few occasions we ⟪k:2⟫"
"did⟪k:3⟫ cross paths, he just gave me a cold glare and nothing more,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Nous vivions dans la même maison mais ne nous parlions jamais. ⟪k:1⟫Les rares fois où l’on "
"se croisait, il me lançait un regard froid, rien de plus,"

#: scenario5:scenario5_07D67BD5_A2F4_4BEF_BBD9_8012DD0C3767
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 856374417b881b259808f1b9013bb858a5bbc7eede09ef59a5ad4c6b56cb5907
#. default-sha256: 4dc403b3e18d1eca4744af9b5ca001c0460bcc0f1767c7a4da6f3d6cf73624ad
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_07D67BD5_A2F4_4BEF_BBD9_8012DD0C3767"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫scorn and suspicion in his eyes."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫le mépris et la méfiance régnaient dans ses yeux."

#: scenario5:scenario5_1559DCC3_8872_4427_8892_A34A50D8C50B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 88af3c7861c8db878aa42d8f65f7f96dcbc621b6513bedf782551f070f7e1864
#. default-sha256: 7f9b6092149f1d18ac6b7e65a5dc9c06b86a16591196d3c6c8ef55ca7197cf8c
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_1559DCC3_8872_4427_8892_A34A50D8C50B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Whenever he looked at me like that, it felt as though my throat was being constricted—⟪k:1⟫"
"⟪k:2⟫like I was deep underwater and running out of air."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Quand il me regardait comme ça, je sentais ma gorge se contracter—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫ comme si "
"j’étais sous l’eau et que je manquais d’air."

#: scenario5:scenario5_E6007ABB_91CF_4C96_87B0_412762DF4126
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9734a0cd6de24fa84cc4c96ec290d6de2bbf1e6a44e685957db6ca6127b8cbec
#. default-sha256: f7bdcb41f133b249b9f433023bd2de4526c8ad77871d7eb5703bfdc220048754
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_E6007ABB_91CF_4C96_87B0_412762DF4126"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Like my very presence in the world was a crime."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Comme si mon existence elle-même était un crime."

#: scenario5:scenario5_2A0AFE93_234A_47B1_9DBC_48F9557EB2C2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e32f9586d8799efc4d8191be8c772a3ed207ec405b0da1ef0cb45f09d31a794d
#. default-sha256: 25105a42ad4877bdcb7f43e8c841e5a6ea7f749f9ea110fae1dfad8538b8e3d0
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_2A0AFE93_234A_47B1_9DBC_48F9557EB2C2"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I never could have imagined just how agonizing constant rejection was."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Je n’aurais jamais imaginer à quel point le rejet constant pouvait être insupportable."

#: scenario5:scenario5_D1864E8B_89E6_4958_A090_C0464B88FE85
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 51d885a50ff1e3b903b47237640dd57b2fa8232ef98d632aa6fb42f9a5937830
#. default-sha256: 1e44d26f894760d49b82841aa90330f44adc3994ee81b0de4b60cc12d684416c
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_D1864E8B_89E6_4958_A090_C0464B88FE85"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I started despising others. ⟪k:1⟫Despising myself. ⟪k:2⟫Despising the world. ⟪k:3⟫Convinced "
"there was no one who could set me free."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Je me mis à mépriser les autres. ⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫À⟪k:3⟫ me mépriser moi-même. ⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫À⟪k:6⟫ "
"mépriser le monde. ⟪k:7⟫Convaincue que personne ne pouvait me sauver."

#: scenario5:scenario5_3FC4E713_D47A_4E6F_B4EE_CA683F2C019D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7c842eb598d739274a752b77376ccff97097ed5b9e4b139705d0ef0927e2160c
#. default-sha256: bf4200955fc63635100bf16951640b12d9eab905b035075f608ed84bb6f1b5bd
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_3FC4E713_D47A_4E6F_B4EE_CA683F2C019D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I considered running away from everything,⟪k:1⟫rather than live like this another day,⟪k:2⟫"
"⟪k:3⟫but I would have done so long ago⟪k:4⟫if that were actually an option."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Je songeai à tout abandonner et à m’enfuir,⟪k:1⟫plutôt que de vivre ainsi un jour de plus,"
"⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫mais je l’aurais fait depuis longtemps⟪k:4⟫si seulement ça avait été possible."

#: scenario5:scenario5_757A2A5F_174D_4D90_9C29_5CE2ECED7F98
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d616c4e01356150f993f7ab2af3c47399e9a08304acb848f0271e30926db3260
#. default-sha256: 4e628b9bbf7697a6ee04b64e48698396ed8ff18401a26e7998328b060be0ce12
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_757A2A5F_174D_4D90_9C29_5CE2ECED7F98"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫If they found out I had fled—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫that I had acted outside their wishes—⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫"
"⟪k:6⟫my mom and sister would pay."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫S’ils apprenaient que je m’étais enfuie —⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫que j’avais agi contre leur souhait —"
"⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫ma mère et ma sœur le payeraient."

#: scenario5:scenario5_F68CEDDD_2CAB_499C_9ACA_72AD323B655D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d8ff27558d5723c9e515ab52168e3714c4dc093daa7bc374342bc3f2401943d6
#. default-sha256: 9e03c3b487772976a2c1bb1717d2e1e1a342cd12d0a42e56b6a60b8f7f647261
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_F68CEDDD_2CAB_499C_9ACA_72AD323B655D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I had succeeded in allowing my sister to get married and my mom to live comfortably."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫J’avais réussi à permettre à ma sœur de se marier et à ma mère de vivre confortablement."

#: scenario5:scenario5_E25A3CED_7774_415D_AEA6_094D84FB6A19
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: eca89747cfbf57ff9acf7fceb49c30bcc75ac34ed639de8474dba81d2e1fbcab
#. default-sha256: edeb145d1b30e64094769634b1602af0f787b279bccb941b498724fccf331213
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_E25A3CED_7774_415D_AEA6_094D84FB6A19"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I had given them happiness. ⟪k:1⟫I couldn’t take that away from them again."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Je leur avais donné le bonheur. ⟪k:1⟫Je ne pouvais le leur enlever."

#: scenario5:scenario5_1F90D50D_BAFD_4302_908B_EAF92C1E9A62
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 171def88119da36f7c95655dc93d40f69e52844ff6fed32f605e1aa65fdc1d5a
#. default-sha256: 38a7fe791633da57f39e261061ba9474facaab4328ed29b63e14d107fa8faecd
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_1F90D50D_BAFD_4302_908B_EAF92C1E9A62"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Not after what I had to go through to do it..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Pas après ce que j’avais subi pour y arriver..."

#: scenario5:scenario5_4B56EE6C_CABE_431B_B956_5F22B7F6E3BB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6efc705f3128cd902180e6e085e74e4b8cdc9ca807d80eac65ce49750964cc72
#. default-sha256: 48f41697b22461c825c2f67ac00db3078091b23a05c42741f58ec0ffc02c435d
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_4B56EE6C_CABE_431B_B956_5F22B7F6E3BB"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫............"

#: scenario5:scenario5_24AEBBE7_47E0_44B0_87BA_A66DB1135D9C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1c4d65fe17b7f08942818064eb018a9e3ce7c4d3571a0067d907b275e35db594
#. default-sha256: 8fc647c94ca9b20e3aa431c4d768c91bb2027ccd72e9f633bb559f1129c658c7
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_24AEBBE7_47E0_44B0_87BA_A66DB1135D9C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫(Ahh, no, cut that out. ⟪k:1⟫Getting way too depressing, Giselle.)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫(Ahh, non, arrête. ⟪k:1⟫Tu broies du noir, Giselle.)"

#: scenario5:scenario5_34E62882_D5D5_4A9B_BF33_6F512D474499
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 409f55983781024b469b3d29ab8e1e421314e137cdd419620f850510884c5d86
#. default-sha256: 787d956636ad40df8f7eb155bdc420a2ac75256a4056a46b4d37e93a6c73583b
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_34E62882_D5D5_4A9B_BF33_6F512D474499"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫(Pull yourself together! That’s not who you are!)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫(Reprends-toi ! Ce n’est pas toi !)"

#: scenario5:scenario5_52516148_D540_4B8B_9ED3_E4A440C7D635
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 96d0a5bd5d9148be784d3b7b8ae7b04494cddc5e890068fc099330cbc8f142bd
#. default-sha256: 2a827a2ac4264100d06d7fd9ab0720436c6038ae43142ce61c3a34967e8adc42
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_52516148_D540_4B8B_9ED3_E4A440C7D635"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫(Be positive...)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫(Sois positive...)"

#: scenario5:scenario5_3B825B3F_B73A_424F_899B_CBEC47FC64B2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 03dad77d5913d1e3e7703ef6d0a19745fe635210b6334fc6b8771aed44f66e54
#. default-sha256: 19ef4d5aa038161b1e34f570e4a078782d8df1a9456417b9ecd805485d741e3b
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_3B825B3F_B73A_424F_899B_CBEC47FC64B2"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The negativity didn’t only come from my interactions with Michel, either."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫L’atmosphère négative ne semblait pas venir uniquement de mes interactions avec Michel."

#: scenario5:scenario5_7AFA77F6_FA10_4264_BB52_DF2C294495FE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 40c3c29fac2ff00c0ef15bfbfab304e2ab5847846ac090e5f9486b0319732a8e
#. default-sha256: 2b6886d3b397b574fdb70a1f2264c2ab3eb1d3f2238bef4972aba50414caacfc
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_7AFA77F6_FA10_4264_BB52_DF2C294495FE"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫No, there seemed to be some kind of terrible presence within the mansion that twisted "
"people’s hearts."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Non, on aurait dit qu’il y avait une sorte de présence oppressante dans le manoir qui "
"corrompait le cœur des gens."

#: scenario5:scenario5_1589DC9A_45CF_4954_92B8_A4547B1F788F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d341f36c701196a4051d0673bb71d73582f89375b0e017fe826f6d54821691bd
#. default-sha256: 5cdafd5b64b856e4b5f39715a4b35a88cba189ac420f703355a7765310fcda13
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_1589DC9A_45CF_4954_92B8_A4547B1F788F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The mansion was, in fact, a bit of a local legend, which I had been informed about before "
"being sent here."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Le manoir, en fait, était une légende dans la région, ce dont on m’avait informé avant de "
"m’envoyer y vivre."

#: scenario5:scenario5_7EB45A40_619F_4322_815C_A619C5B4A533
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 15cf9fa75f8a39f4dd4f68affffa2bd07447eb90eba2e6a234c0ee4fb55a23eb
#. default-sha256: db463d0772310a029df6c45716cc983e2755e575810b9e377bb94f11a42da01d
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_7EB45A40_619F_4322_815C_A619C5B4A533"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫People claimed it was cursed, and that an evil witch had lived in it for many, many years."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Les gens affirmaient qu’il était maudit et qu’une sorcière maléfique y vivait depuis de très "
"nombreuses années."

#: scenario5:scenario5_75C08C9A_09D8_48D0_84FB_2B452D642BFC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 064e4c102716267489d04061b04a6f84b0cfd643746bf3650b4ac7d4a5baaa35
#. default-sha256: 67cfc0e3bc1eb64209140ee6e59cf9c0c342bf8775e42f05cb4d5713909fb0e3
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_75C08C9A_09D8_48D0_84FB_2B452D642BFC"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Michel joked that he was the witch, but I didn’t believe him."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Michel plaisantait en disant qu’il était la sorcière mais je ne le croyais pas."

